  Alpha AXP System to be Server for New Commercial Internet Service


San Jose, Cal. -- June 1, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation 
announced today that it is a core technology partner with MecklerWeb, 
providing an Alpha AXP server and systems integration resources for 
launching the new commercial Internet service.  

     "Digital is proud to be a core technology partner with 
MecklerWeb, providing the Alpha AXP system that will be the compute 
