              DIGITAL AND GENESYS SOLUTIONS GROUP, INC.
         ANNOUNCE INTERNATIONAL AGREEMENT TO JOINTLY MARKET
                      SYSTEM FOR RETAIL BANKING


    Digital and Genesys Client/Server Solution For Retail Banking


SAN FRANCISCO, CA -- June 6, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation 
and Genesys Solutions Group, Inc., today announced that they have 
signed an international agreement to jointly market the Genesys 
Solutions Integrated Sales and Service System.  Under the terms of 
the agreement, Digital will distribute the Genesys software 
internationally as its DECbank FBS+ banking solution for branch 
sales and customer service centers.  Genesys will provide consulting 
and implementation services to Digital for these projects and will 
continue to enhance the product.

     Whether face to face in a branch, or over the phone in a 
centralized Customer Service Center, the Genesys system enables 
Banks to deliver sales and service excellence to their customers by 
providing consolidated relationship, product and service information 
at the customer's choice of contact. The Genesys Solutions 
application provides easy-to-use access to back office information 
complemented with sales and service tools traditionally not 
available to Bankers.

     "Our years of experience creating sales and service systems for 
banking have resulted in a solution that clearly improves sales and 
service productivity  and increases the quality of customer 
service,"  said Cliff Potenza, President of Genesys Solutions Group, 
Inc.  "We see explosive growth in telephone customer service centers 
in U.S. banks.  Consumers insist on convenience, and banks that 
deliver consistent quality service in branches and on the phone will 
win the consumer's loyalty.  It makes sense to use a common 
infrastructure to provide that service."

     The client/server solution comprises Windows based client 
functionality and Windows NT based services for application 
functionality, communications and data base services, as well as 
software distribution and system management.  Access to central site 
information is accomplished through an IBM Host Interface Gateway 
that also is included in the agreement. 

     Larsake Sandin, Digital's manager of retail banking said, 
"Internationally, we see a lot of movement to remote banking 
facilities.  The Genesys Solutions products complement Digital's 
teller and self service banking solutions.  Together we are leading 
our customers to a new level of service for their customers."

     Genesys Solutions develops software applications that help 
Banks sell and service their customers.  With over 75 years of 
collective experience in solution design and implementation, Bank 
branch management, Bank management consulting, and sales management, 
Genesys Solutions is uniquely qualified to help create sales and 
service excellence in Bank/customer interactions. 

     Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open 
client/server solutions from personal computing to integrated 
worldwide information systems.  Digital's scalable Alpha AXP 
platforms, storage, networking, software and services, together 
with industry-focused solutions from business partners, help 
organizations compete and win in today's global marketplace.
