                           FACT SHEET


PRODUCT NAME: DECcolorwriter 520ic Color Ink Jet Printer

OVERVIEW:

The DECcolorwriter 520ic is a Color Write Out of the Box, 
narrow-carriage ink jet printer which includes separate 
monochrome and color ink cartridges, a 150-page paper input, a 
low-ink indicator, and ships with a Windows 3.1 printer driver.  
The printer can be directly connected to any PC and has the 
paper-handling, duty cycle and color clarity for office 
applications.

KEY FEATURES AND BENEFITS:

o 50 nozzle print head with separate color and monochrome ink 
  cartridges.
o Snap-in replacement monochrome ink cartridge saves up to 40% 
  consumables cost.
o Low-ink indicator.
o 300 X 300 dpi resolution.
o Parallel interface.
o PCL 3E (HP DeskJet 500C) emulation.
o 128 KB RAM.
o Low 48 dBA operating noise level.
o Windows 3.1 printer driver.
o Fast.  Monochrome speed:  400 cps (5 ppm) draft, 160 cps (2 
  ppm) LQ.  						         
o Single 150 page input tray.
