"talk-back" in real-time to the user or system manager with both 
job and printer status.

The PrintServer Software continues to extend Digital's commitment 
to Open Systems.  The required PrintServer Software resides on 
any of the current operating systems that are supported by 
Digital: Pyramid OSx, Sequent Dynix, Silicon Graphics IRIX, 
Solaris, UNISYS System V,  OpenVMS (VAX and AXP), ULTRIX, HP-UX, 
