SHREWSBURY, MA -- June 21, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation's 
Storage Business Unit today announced it has appointed Jack Sharp, 
51, vice president of sales and marketing for its newly named 
AVASTOR business.  Sharp, who reports to Charles F. Christ, vice 
president of Digital's Storage Business Unit, is responsible for 
worldwide sales and marketing of AVASTOR's magnetic disk, digital 
linear tape (DLT), and solid state disk products.  Sharp previously 
was manager of sales and marketing for Digital's OEM Storage 
