AVASTOR.  This appointment recognizes his strong leadership, which 
has resulted in a 350% increase in OEM, reseller and distributor 
sales revenues over the last fiscal year," said Charlie Christ,
vice president of Digital's Storage Business Unit.  "Jack's 
appointment will help AVASTOR continue this strong growth as the 
business aggressively competes in worldwide markets."

     "I'm pleased to be involved in Digital's efforts to strengthen 
its leadership in the  storage components industry," said Jack 
Sharp.  "As the market demands higher-performance, higher-capacity 
components, AVASTOR's expertise in this arena will enable us to 
substantially increase our marketshare."

